{"parentUuid":"e22a7070-5b02-40b5-99b2-e3cb6e4b5fe2","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01DY3zZir7tqLiF8xUNh1Zos","copy":"wire"},{"id":"toolu_016Rn2tzhBqxopsetz9spske","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"73ff9cfa-b336-4670-a65c-3ec8ffc69796","timestamp":"2026-10-31T17:43:43.352Z","session_id":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"pure-pondering-goose"}
{"parentUuid":"73ff9cfa-b336-4670-a65c-3ec8ffc69796","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgajFfFdmKvaWBTYJvYZx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The A7 live exit passed every step except the merge, which I left for you. `a19d688` records the exit in `PLAN.md` and adds the fix below; its push to GitHub is still running.\n\n**Exit results on `ianparo/bastion`:**\n- **From an issue:** job `j7eb804a7` started from issue #1, and its page links back to the issue.\n- **Pull request:** Bastion opened pull request #2 from branch `bastion/j7eb804a7`, with \"Closes #1\" in its description.\n- **CI:** it failed on the missing `CHANGELOG.md` entry. Bastion started a fix turn with the CI log, the fixed change went to the same pull request, and CI then passed.\n- **Settings restore:** I set the forge to GitHub (version 1), then the medium preset set both checkpoints to hold (version 2). Restoring version 1 wrote version 3, which put them back to \"ask\" (wait for you). The next job, `ja0b04eb6`, waited at approve with no hold timer, so it used the restored value. I stopped it afterward.\n\n**What needs you:** job `j7eb804a7` is waiting at land with CI green. Open it and click Approve: Bastion merges pull request #2, deletes the branch, and issue #1 closes.\n\n**What the exit found:**\n- **The automatic CI fix didn't fix CI.** Bastion gave the agent only the end of the log, and the actual error (\"CHANGELOG.md has no entry\") was cut off. It took a note from me before the agent added the line. Fix turns need the failing step's own error lines; I'll make that change next.\n- **Settings sections didn't refresh.** After a change, other parts of the Settings page kept old values. Fixed in `a19d688`: each change now tells the page to re-read.\n- **Agent behavior:**\n  - It asks permission before acting on a note.\n  - It ignored part of one note: it moved the tests into a `tests/` folder after I said to keep them at the root.\n  - My note told it to reset to `origin/main`, which doesn't exist inside the job's VM. The right target is `@{u}`, the branch the job started from.\n- **The webview freeze is my test tool, most likely.** It came back with spellcheck off. The tool I use to drive the window (cmux-cua) reads the same page attribute after each scroll and keystroke; driving with plain keys avoided it. I haven't checked whether a screen reader like VoiceOver triggers it too.\n- **Badges look like buttons.** The \"Approve\" and \"Review\" labels on the Jobs list are badges, but I clicked one expecting it to act."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1879,"cache_read_input_tokens":902375,"output_tokens":856,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1879,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":856,"cache_read_input_tokens":902375,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1879,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1879},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8193fa79-fd14-4454-987b-acff5cad7062","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgajFen7FdG2fssy9D9fn","type":"assistant","uuid":"4f11a146-479f-49e6-b912-e05cf91ca132","timestamp":"2026-10-31T17:43:43.347Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"pure-pondering-goose"}
