{"parentUuid":"241c9526-e367-4a32-8703-846ce82b6d34","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01FNwkEpiVEy36AdLGtvzcr6","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"bd953f5f-2659-419e-8142-8a460069726a","timestamp":"2026-10-31T17:57:34.044Z","session_id":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"pure-pondering-goose"}
{"parentUuid":"bd953f5f-2659-419e-8142-8a460069726a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgakK47zon6GbAppPhuM7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I closed A7 and reworked the Constraints and Capabilities pages as you asked. Each page now has Charter, Harness and Factory sections. The changes are pushed (`062cd3e`). I haven't seen the new pages in the window yet: the dev app had stopped at its 2-hour limit and is starting up again.\n\n**A7 is closed:**\n- Approving at land merged pull request #2 into `ianparo/bastion`, deleted its branch, closed issue #1, and pulled `main` in `~/Code/bastion`.\n- I was wrong earlier about why the CI fix turn failed. The agent received the full log, including \"CHANGELOG.md has no entry\", and still didn't add the line; I had checked the job's note after the turn cleared it. The plan now says so.\n- CI logs now reach the agent cleaned to the failing lines. Whether gpt-5-mini then fixes CI by itself isn't measured yet.\n\n**The pages:**\n- **Constraints:**\n  - Charter: each repository's own rules and hooks, read from its `.claude/settings.json`, or \"no charter\" when it has none.\n  - Harness: rules on an agent's calls.\n  - Factory: rules on the pipeline, such as `tests-kept` at review.\n  - The add form stays at the bottom.\n- **Capabilities:**\n  - Charter: each repository's allow list. Bastion reads it, but the harness grants still decide.\n  - Harness: what an agent's calls may do at each stage.\n  - Factory: what the factory itself may do, as your Settings set it: approving plans and changes, landing or opening a pull request, merging, and CI fix turns.\n\n**Your \"no code changes\" rule:** I recorded it in the plan as D26. Today the default harness and factory rules are written in Bastion's code. The first job of A8 is to move them into the iii stack's configuration, so you can change them by editing the stack. That needs a spike first on iii's `configuration` worker, which appears to store and announce config changes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":766,"cache_read_input_tokens":943033,"output_tokens":654,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":766,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":654,"cache_read_input_tokens":943033,"cache_creation_input_tokens":766,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":766},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"09153b1e-902a-429f-a31f-96f50b835dab","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgakK3fDyFeARx62tRigM","type":"assistant","uuid":"2f0c8748-da6f-4caf-b420-dbc2091c2d77","timestamp":"2026-10-31T17:57:34.042Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/tacoda/tacoda/bastion","sessionId":"135a2369-1f42-433b-aacc-5c1b0ce18b48","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"main","slug":"pure-pondering-goose"}
